<description>&lt;p&gt;Mass killings of Orthodox Christians resumed in Oromia, with attackers killing at least 60 believers in two separate incidents. Violence in Gambella left 12 dead and more than 80 injured, according to MSF. Over 35,000 Ethiopians have fled across the border into Kenya, intensifying the humanitarian crisis. The UN mission in Somalia has concluded and the UN food programme has appointed a new head amid the renewed conflict. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPekdsSDliU2RjRzRFQ0VqdjBuam9DYnAwUHhRalk5aDI4TWhWZFJNRzcyMy1BT2p5MUhBWFpkSkhaX3BRUHVydkRscl9vOHJ2VFUtLV9WVnRoUEh5VzY3NUVxdTBHN3VxWDBsM1ZSZ0duRDRmcXhPWDAwMW5Gdnd4QlNlNy15dlZJWkEzaUtCdUdHWDB5dW13QVhtdVA3N2h2LUVDeWpQQjNSU096d1k5U1NrTWQ3Ym44S1ZHVE1CcUxucktvN2dLWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Baptist Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5kM0R1NEdiMHhhN3lHSm9CaG9INURHZnVxTlFDMThwNEQwMk1pZVRqTU5LNDhTMzFia3VnLUxjdzFyUFR0UktlUFR6VlpodU9sSnlwTjlaaFNoeldVMVlGeF9OMkc4X280?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNVjljLWN2QS1MVGNnNHdrWVV3aFJzcnpzd184NndrWjFVUFdHR0xIMzVNbEdXSFlYV2FUSkZQaVJrNzhNUEl3T3NabjRMcldiT09IOWdlU21MeEFSOGRBRmIwNnpQVnlpcnlLVHZuUEkwbjNFQ1FaZ1l6UFNUYmJSSm9aYWRYRkxjOFNoTEpSRUlweHhySFp3a0lFZERFdDdUeVVyUHl3alRjQ0EzM3lkVjIwakxHd0duTTZfeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE00VXRIcXdwSFRtMW9WRnYzcXFxWU53b3BvV3EyUzBQc0JXV3VQUEpLNTkzQlFXMHliQlJZYVpMc2ZQYjFRbTExQmJVcklOVmJadEpqWGhwOHp3SFNSQzF6RnNIX051QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Angelus News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9